           Drone Intrusion Detection System

PUSHPAK Grand Challenge 3: Security of Drones, Objective 2

Stage 2 -- Detailed Evidence-Supported IDS Report Template

This template is intended for the Stage 2 detailed submission. Teams are expected to go
beyond the Stage 1 proof of concept and provide validation evidence from actual flight
operation, on real and traceable data, that builds confidence the intrusion detection system can
be deployed on a UAV and subsequently tested in flight.

