Submission note: Keep the main report concise and evidence-driven. Source code, test suites,
flight logs and datasets, attack-injection scripts, ground-truth files, result files and the
demonstration video must be included in the submitted archive; a link alone is not sufficient.
Detailed results, extra plots and raw outputs may be attached as appendices. Results from
actual flight operation carry full weight; results from simulated or generated data are treated as
design evidence and carry limited weight. The emphasis is on traceable methodology, detectors
that decide from telemetry and not from test labels, and results that come from the submitted
code on the data described.

